  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nAccording to BODMAS Rule\n\n \n \n\n \n \n**B**\n\n \n \n \n**Brackets in order**\n\n \n \n \n\n \n \nO\n\n \n \n \nOf\n\n \n \n \n\n \n \nD\n\n \n \n \nDivision\n\n \n \n \n\n \n \nM\n\n \n \n \nMultiplication\n\n \n \n \n\n \n \nA\n\n \n \n \nAddition\n\n \n \n \n\n \n \nS\n\n \n \n \nSubtraction\n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n**Given equation**: 41 * 2 * 36 * 6 * 57 * 7 * 4 * 3\n\nOption 1 : Using the combination +, −, =, ×, −, ÷, −\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n41 + 2 - 36 = 6 × 57 - **7 ÷ 4** - 3\n\n41 + 2 - 36 = **6 × 57** - 1.75 - 3\n\n**41 + 2** - 36 = 342 - 1.75 - 3\n\n**43 - 36 **= **342 - 1.75 - 3**\n\n7 ≠ 337.2 ( LHS ≠ RHS )\n\nOption 2 : Using the combination −, =, +, ×, −, +, ×\n\n41 - 2 = 36 + **6 × 57** - 7 + 4 × 3\n\n41 - 2= **36 + 342** - 7 **+ 12**\n\n**41 - 2** = **390 - 7**\n\n39 ≠ 383 ( LHS ≠ RHS )\n\n**Option 3: Using the combination ×, +, ÷, −, =, ×, +**\n\n41 × 2 + **36 ÷ 6** - 57 = 7 × 4 + 3\n\n**41 × 2** + 6 - 57 = **7 × 4** + 3\n\n**82 + 6 **- 57 = **28 + 3**\n\n88 - 57 = 31\n\n**31 = 31 ( LHS = RHS )**\n\nOption 4: Using the combination −, +, ×, −, =, +, ×\n\n41 - 2 + **36 × 6** - 57 = 7 + **4 × 3**\n\n**41** - 2 **+ 216** - 57 = **7 + 12**\n\n**257 - 2 - 57** = 19\n\n**257 - 59** = 19\n\n198 ≠ 19 ( LHS ≠ RHS )\n\nHence,** ×, +, ÷, −, =, ×, +** is the **correct answer.**",
